{"unit_id":"Inceptzws__dsh-project-guard#card-zh","repo":"Inceptzws/dsh-project-guard","commit":"1962a4896b32d66030feaa35d8bd705086f4a0a4","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-project-guard 是面向 DSH 的项目范围权限与后果说明插件，接入工具执行和审批流程。它根据工具、参数、工作目录和沙箱模式分类调用：项目内操作继续执行，范围外或系统相关操作进入用户确认，部分会破坏机器或中断会话的操作直接拒绝，并将确认请求排队且优先处理系统相关请求。启用说明层后，它会把动作影响预览附在确认提示中，也可在执行后追加预测与实际变化报告。适合希望在 DSH 中管理项目外操作确认、了解操作影响并保留校准记录的开发者；无需 API Key，使用 dsh plugin add dsh-project-guard 安装。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:159-200","index.js:210-260","lib/engine.js:122-181"]}
{"unit_id":"Inceptzws__dsh-project-guard#card-en","repo":"Inceptzws/dsh-project-guard","commit":"1962a4896b32d66030feaa35d8bd705086f4a0a4","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-project-guard adds project-scoped permission checks and consequence previews to DSH tools. Out-of-project calls can require approval, selected actions are refused, and approvals are queued. Optional reports compare predicted and observed changes. Install with dsh plugin add dsh-project-guard.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:159-200","index.js:210-260","lib/engine.js:122-181"]}
